  "孩子有了更方便的活动连接，家人的日常安排也更从容。": "The children now have more convenient activity connections, and the family's daily schedule is more relaxed.",
  "扩充儿童活动设施": "Expand children's activity facilities",
  "集中增加成长所需的活动设施，其他社区活动需重新协调。": "Concentrate on adding more activity facilities needed for growing up; other community activities need to be re-coordinated.",
  "成长中的孩子获得了更多空间，也带来新的公共使用安排。": "Growing children gain more space, which also brings new public use arrangements.",
  "熟悉的味道怎样继续": "How can familiar flavors continue",
  "黄美兰可以自主安排营业，熟客仍有继续联系的地方。": "Huang Meilan can arrange her business independently, and regular customers still have a place to stay in touch.",
  "建立常态邻里聚点": "Establish regular neighbourhood gathering points.",
  "集中建立不依赖摊主营业的聚点，其他家庭支持会分阶段推进。": "Focus on establishing gathering points that do not depend on the stallholder's business; other family support will be rolled out in stages.",
  "相聚不再完全依赖一个摊位，其他支持也需要继续补足。": "Gatherings no longer depend entirely on one stall, and other support also needs to be continuously supplemented.",
  "第七年，曾经的支持要继续衔接，也要容纳不断变化的工作节奏。": "In the seventh year, former support must continue to connect, and also accommodate constantly changing work rhythms.",
  "让支持持续下去": "Keep the support going",
  "库马尔与德薇希望照护服务联系更加连贯。": "Kumar and Devi want more consistent links between care services.",
  "家里经历了多次安排调整。社区能帮助联络与衔接，但不能把活动中心说成全天专业照护。": "The family has been through many changes in arrangements. The community can help with connection and coordination, but cannot present the activity centre as round-the-clock professional care.",
  "今年哪一段支持最容易断开，需要帮忙衔接？": "Which part of the support is most likely to break down this year and needs help to connect?",
  "定期跟进服务衔接": "Follow up regularly on service coordination",
  "配合轮班习惯改善公共使用与生活便利。": "Improve public use and everyday convenience to suit shift-work habits.",
  "日常环境更照顾不同作息，邻居也更理解彼此的需要。": "The daily environment better accommodates different schedules, and neighbours understand each other's needs more.",
  "重点更新休息环境": "Focus on upgrading rest environments.",
  "集中更新相关环境，其他住户的个案支持需分步处理。": "Concentrate on upgrading the relevant environments; case support for other residents must be handled in stages.",
  "休息条件进一步改善，也要继续留意其他家庭的个别困难。": "Rest conditions improve further, while continuing to watch for individual difficulties in other families.",
  "忙碌之后的小家": "A small home after busy days",
  "阿丽希望轮班后的休息环境与日常设施更合适。": "Ali hopes for a better rest environment and daily facilities after shifts.",
  "工作节奏这些年不断变化。她需要能够调整的安静约定，也需要好用的休息环境。": "Work rhythms keep changing over the years. She needs quiet agreements that can be adjusted, and a usable rest environment.",
  "今年休息时，环境和邻里安排还缺哪一块？": "This year when resting, which part of the environment and neighbor arrangements is still missing?",
  "调整休息友好环境": "Adjust the rest-friendly environment",
  "核实已有安排和新增缺口，连接正式服务。": "Verify existing arrangements and new gaps, and connect to formal services.",
  "家属更清楚谁负责跟进，也能及时说明新的缺口。": "Families have a clearer idea of who is following up, and can promptly flag new gaps.",
  "强化社区支持网络": "Strengthen community support networks.",
  "集中增加持续联络与支持能力，环境提升投入暂时减少。": "Concentrate on increasing ongoing contact and support capacity; temporarily reduce investment in environmental improvements.",
  "支持联系更稳定，公共环境改善仍需在后续兼顾。": "Support contact is more stable; public environment improvements still need to be addressed later.",
  "第八年，社区的发展来到新的讨论阶段，个案与公共决定都需要被看见。": "In the eighth year, community development enters a new stage of discussion, where both individual cases and public decisions need to be seen.",
  "往后的家怎样安排": "How to plan the home for the years ahead",
  "拉赫曼与努尔想再次核实适合晚年的住房选择。": "Rahman and Nur want to reconfirm housing options suitable for their later years.",
  "这些年他们对手续更熟悉，但新的住房选择仍需重新咨询，不能把过去的支持当成结果保证。": "They have become more familiar with procedures over the years, but new housing options still require fresh consultation; past support cannot be treated as a guarantee of outcomes.",
  "今年考虑往后的住屋时，最希望核实什么？": "When considering housing for the years ahead this year, what do you most want to verify?",
  "住房转衔得到更多支持，相处活动也需要继续兼顾。": "Housing transition needs more support, while social activities must also continue.",
  "更新之前先听居民": "Listen to residents before renewing",
  "张叔希望新一轮社区更新先说明影响，再收集意见。": "Uncle Zhang wants the new round of community renewal to explain impacts first, then gather feedback.",
  "住户的处境已有变化。公开说明和合资格居民的实际同意程序不能由管理者的信任分数代替。": "Residents' circumstances have changed. Public disclosure and the actual consent process for eligible residents cannot be replaced by the manager's trust score.",
