  "复核晚年住房选择": "Review housing options for later life",
  "重新核对资料与现实选择，说明下一步。": "Recheck information and real choices, and explain the next step.",
  "夫妻能够按新的情况作决定，后续结果仍有清楚的跟进。": "The couple can decide based on the new situation, and later outcomes still have clear follow-up.",
  "集中提供住房转衔支持": "Provide focused housing transition support",
