  "讨论渠道更完整，实际环境更新仍需按程序继续推进。": "Discussion channels are more complete; actual environmental updates still need to proceed through procedures.",
  "第九年，发展也包括照顾已经建好的东西，以及再次来到这里的人。": "Year nine: development also means caring for what has already been built, and for those who come here again.",
  "把日常维护好": "Keep daily life well maintained",
