  "她更需要熟悉路线上的稳定支持。以前建好的设施，也要继续维护才能发挥作用。": "She needs more stable support along familiar routes. Facilities built before also need continued maintenance to remain useful.",
  "说明影响并收集意见": "Explain the impact and gather opinions.",
  "让不同家庭了解变化，再表达自己的判断。": "Help different households understand the changes, then express their own judgment.",
  "居民更明白更新与自己有什么关系，参与也更充分。": "Residents better understand how renewal relates to them and participate more fully.",
