  "传递约定与欢迎新邻居": "Pass on the agreement and welcome new neighbours",
  "用清楚的说明和轻量交流帮助新邻居融入。": "Use clear explanations and light interaction to help new neighbours settle in.",
  "共同约定更容易被后来的人理解，租住生活也更稳定。": "The shared agreement is easier for newcomers to understand, and rental living is more stable.",
