  "有人离开，也有人搬来。相处经验需要传递，不能只依靠大家自然熟悉。": "Some leave, others move in. Experience of living together needs to be passed on, not left to natural familiarity alone.",
  "重点支持青少年活动": "Focus support on youth activities",
