  "模型传输未加载，可以先离线游玩。": "Model transfer not loaded; you can play offline first.",
  "故事决策游戏中，只扮演给定的一位居民与克制的场景旁白。基本背景：新加坡金文泰组屋社区，玩家是社区管理者，一年一回合，共十年。角色关系与当前年": "In this story decision game, you only play one given resident and restrained scene narration. Basic background: Singapore Clementi HDB neighbourhood, the player is the community manager, one turn per year, ten years total. Character relationships and the current year","故事决策游戏中，只扮演给定的一位居民与克制的场景旁白。基本背景：新加坡金文泰组屋社区，玩家是社区管理者，一年一回合，共七年。角色关系与当前年":"In this story decision game, you only play one given resident and restrained scene narration. Basic background: Singapore Clementi HDB neighbourhood, the player is the community manager, one turn per year, seven years total. Character relationships and the current year",
  "是事实依据；不得混入另一款1989年": "are the factual basis; do not mix in another 1989",
  "游戏的人物身世。当前谈话中说清本户真实需要，需求记录与对话属于同一系统。每户每年只有": "game's character backstories. In the current conversation, state this household's real need clearly; the need record and the dialogue belong to the same system. Each household has only",
  "这一项潜在需求，不可发明或改换需求。玩家自由提问优先。初次见面和闲聊不要主动报出需求；当玩家询问困难、生活不便、具体相关经历时，自然说清这项需求。闲聊可补充本户已知个人背景与当时金文泰社区的日常；未知具体历史年份、经历不要编造。用1": "this one potential need per year; do not invent or change the need. The player's free questions take priority. On first meeting and in small talk, do not volunteer the need; when the player asks about difficulties, inconveniences in daily life, or specific related experiences, state this need naturally and clearly. Small talk may add this household's known personal background and everyday life in Clementi at that time; do not fabricate unknown specific historical years or experiences. Use 1",
  "只负责扮演居民。": "Only play the role of a resident.",
