Object.assign((typeof window!=="undefined"?window:globalThis).CM_YEAR_TRANSLATIONS,{"这件事最需要先解决什么？": "What most needs sorting out first?", "第3座高楼层住户": "High-floor residents of Block 3", "第3座电梯更换，停运三个月": "Block 3’s lifts are shut for three months of replacement", "电梯停运的三个月": "Three months without a lift", "我们住得高，电梯一停，老人和推婴儿车的都出不了门。": "We live high up. With the lifts off, older folk and parents with prams can’t get out.", "第3座开始更换电梯，停运期间高楼层的老人、孩子和行动不便的住户每天要爬十几层楼。": "Block 3’s lifts are being replaced. While they are off, older residents, children and anyone with limited mobility on the high floors climb a dozen storeys every day.", "组织上下楼互助": "Organise stair help", "安排邻居志愿者陪同上下楼、代买日用品。": "Neighbour volunteers help people up and down the stairs and run errands.", "停运期间，高楼层的老人仍能按时出门、复诊。": "While the lifts are off, older high-floor residents still get out on time and keep their appointments.", "增设楼梯休息点": "Add stairwell rest stops", "在各楼层设休息座椅并改善楼梯照明，施工期间楼道会更拥挤。": "Benches on every landing and better stair lighting; the stairwells are more crowded during the works.", "楼梯间有了休息点，上下楼不再那么难熬，楼道也因此挤了一阵。": "The stairwells now have places to rest, so the climb is easier, though they were crowded for a while.", "金文泰第2区居民": "Residents of Clementi Zone 2", "附近出现骨痛热症病例群": "A dengue cluster has been reported nearby", "骨痛热症病例群": "A dengue cluster", "楼下积水一直没人清，孩子被蚊子咬得满腿包，我们很担心。": "Nobody clears the standing water downstairs and the children’s legs are covered in bites. We are worried.", "国家环境局公布附近出现骨痛热症病例群，排水沟与花盆积水成了隐患，有住户已经住院。": "The NEA has reported a dengue cluster nearby. Standing water in drains and flower pots is a risk, and some residents are already in hospital.", "发动邻里清积水": "Rally neighbours to clear water", "组织每周十分钟清理积水，挨家提醒。": "A weekly ten-minute clear-up of standing water, with reminders door to door.", "邻居一起清掉了积水，病例渐渐少了。": "Neighbours cleared the standing water together and cases gradually fell.", "整修排水与公共绿地": "Repair drains and green spaces", "疏通排水沟、改造积水绿地，施工期间部分通道要绕行。": "Unblock drains and regrade waterlogged lawns; some paths are diverted during the works.", "积水点被一一改造，社区更不容易滋生蚊虫。": "One by one the waterlogged spots were fixed, and mosquitoes breed less easily now.", "底层与低洼路段住户": "Ground-floor and low-lying households", "暴雨过后，底层和车道严重积水": "After a downpour, the void deck and roads flood badly", "暴雨后的积水": "Flooding after the storm", "一下大雨，底层就淹到脚踝，老人和孩子根本过不去。": "Whenever it pours, the void deck floods ankle-deep. Older people and children simply can’t get through.", "一场短时暴雨让底层和低洼路段积水，送餐、上学和看病的路都被截断。": "A short, heavy storm flooded the void decks and low-lying paths, cutting off meal deliveries, school runs and clinic visits.", "设立雨天绕行指引": "Set up rainy-day detours", "标出可走的有盖路线，安排志愿者在积水点引导。": "Mark the covered routes that stay dry and post volunteers at flooded spots.", "雨天时居民知道该怎么绕行，出门不再冒险。": "On rainy days residents know which way to go, and going out is no longer a gamble.", "改造低洼路段与排水": "Raise low paths and drains", "加高低洼路面、扩大排水口，工程期间要分段封路。": "Raise the low-lying paths and widen the drains; sections close in turn during the works.", "改造后的路段不再积水，雨天出门安心多了。": "The rebuilt paths no longer flood, and going out in the rain feels safe again.", "独居长者与轮班住户": "Older residents living alone and shift workers", "连续数周高温，有长者中暑送医": "Weeks of heat; an older resident is taken to hospital", "热得睡不着的夏天": "Too hot to sleep", "屋里像蒸笼，白天睡不了、晚上也睡不好，有老人已经中暑了。": "The flat is like a steamer. You can’t sleep by day or by night, and one old man has already had heatstroke.", "连续数周的高温让顶楼和西晒的单位格外闷热，独居长者和下夜班补眠的住户最难熬。": "Weeks of heat have made top-floor and west-facing flats stifling. It is hardest for older people living alone and for night-shift workers trying to sleep.", "开放清凉休息点": "Open cool rest spots", "在社区中心开放有冷气的休息角，安排邻居互相问候。": "An air-conditioned rest corner at the community centre, with neighbours checking on each other.", "最热的日子里，长者有地方纳凉，也有人留意他们。": "On the hottest days, older residents have somewhere cool to go and someone looking out for them.", "建设遮阴与降温空间": "Build shade and cooling spaces", "在底层与步道加建遮阴和通风设施，施工期间会占用部分公共空间。": "Add shade and ventilation on the void deck and walkways; part of the public space is taken during the works.", "社区多了几处阴凉，炎热的日子里也能在楼下坐坐。": "The neighbourhood gained shady spots, so people can sit downstairs even on hot days.", "第5座受影响的住户": "Affected households in Block 5", "第5座一个单位起火，几户人家暂时无法回家": "A flat fire in Block 5 leaves several families unable to go home", "火灾之后": "After the fire", "房子熏黑了，要修好几个月，我们一家暂时没地方落脚。": "The flat is blackened with smoke and repairs will take months. Our family has nowhere to stay for now.", "第5座一个单位因电动车充电起火，走廊被熏黑，几户人家需要暂住别处，等待修缮。": "A charging e-scooter set a Block 5 flat on fire. The corridor is blackened and several families must stay elsewhere while repairs are made.", "协调临时安置与互助": "Arrange temporary stays and help", "联络亲友和邻居提供暂住，组织捐赠日用品。": "Line up relatives and neighbours to host families and collect donated essentials.", "受影响的家庭有了落脚处，邻居们也伸出了援手。": "The affected families found places to stay, and neighbours stepped in to help.", "设立社区援助窗口": "Open a community help desk", "建立一站式援助窗口，协助申请修缮与临时住房，需要长期人手。": "A one-stop desk helps with repair claims and temporary housing; it needs permanent staff.", "受灾家庭的申请有人跟进，修缮和安置更快落实。": "Someone follows up each family’s claims, so repairs and rehousing happen faster.", "几户双职工家庭": "Several dual-income families", "附近工厂裁员，几户家庭突然失去收入": "Layoffs at a nearby plant leave families suddenly without income", "突然没了收入": "Income gone overnight", "公司说关就关，房贷、孩子的学费，下个月都不知道怎么办。": "The company just shut the line. The mortgage, the children’s fees — we don’t know how we’ll manage next month.", "附近的电子厂缩减生产线，几户双职工家庭有人失业，房贷和学费一下子成了难题。": "A nearby electronics plant has cut production lines. Someone in several dual-income families has lost their job, and mortgages and school fees are suddenly a struggle.", "连接就业与援助资源": "Connect jobs and assistance", "协助申请临时援助，介绍就业培训和职位配对。": "Help with temporary assistance applications and refer people to training and job matching.", "失业的居民拿到了临时援助，也开始参加培训找新工作。": "Residents who lost their jobs received temporary help and began training for new work.", "设立就业辅导点": "Set up a job support point", "在社区设立长期就业辅导点，需要专人运营。": "A permanent job support point in the neighbourhood, run by dedicated staff.", "社区有了固定的就业辅导，找工作不再孤立无援。": "With steady job support nearby, looking for work no longer means doing it alone.", "常去食阁的老街坊": "Hawker centre regulars", "食阁闭馆翻新一年，老街坊没了聚脚处": "The hawker centre closes for a year of renovation, and the regulars lose their meeting place", "食阁关门的一年": "A year without the hawker centre", "食阁一关，早上不知道去哪里喝咖啡，老朋友也很难见到了。": "With the hawker centre shut, I don’t know where to have my morning coffee, and I hardly see my old friends.", "食阁闭馆翻新一年，许多老人失去了每天见面的地方，附近的摊贩也暂时搬走。": "The hawker centre has closed for a year of renovation. Many older residents have lost their daily meeting place, and the nearby stalls have moved away for now.", "安排临时聚脚点": "Arrange a temporary meeting spot", "在底层设临时茶座，组织每周的老友聚会。": "A temporary coffee corner on the void deck, with a weekly get-together for old friends.", "食阁翻新期间，老朋友们仍有地方见面聊天。": "While the hawker centre is being renovated, old friends still have somewhere to meet and chat.", "建设社区茶座空间": "Build a community coffee corner", "把一处底层空间改造成固定的社区茶座，占用部分公共空间。": "Turn part of a void deck into a permanent community coffee corner, using some public space.", "社区多了一个固定的聚脚处，食阁重开后也一样热闹。": "The neighbourhood gained a lasting meeting place that stays lively even after the hawker centre reopens.", "独居长者": "Older residents living alone", "一位独居长者跌倒两天后才被发现": "An older resident living alone lay fallen for two days before anyone found her", "没人知道她跌倒了": "Nobody knew she had fallen", "一个人住，最怕的就是跌倒了没人知道。": "Living alone, what I fear most is falling and nobody knowing.", "一位独居长者在家跌倒，两天后才被邻居发现，楼里的独居长者人心惶惶。": "An older resident fell at home and was found by a neighbour only two days later. Others who live alone in the block are frightened.", "建立邻里互相问候": "Start daily neighbour check-ins", "组织邻居每天打个招呼、留意信箱和灯光。": "Neighbours say hello every day and keep an eye on letterboxes and lights.", "独居的长者每天都有人问候，出了事也能很快被发现。": "Older residents living alone hear from someone every day, and trouble is noticed quickly.", "扩建乐龄关怀服务": "Expand senior care services", "扩建乐龄活动中心，增加定期探访与紧急求助联络，需要长期人手。": "Expand the senior activity centre with regular visits and an emergency contact line; it needs permanent staff.", "乐龄关怀扩大后，独居长者有了固定联系的人。": "With senior care expanded, older residents living alone have someone they regularly hear from.", "有学龄孩子的家庭": "Families with school-age children", "校车公司停运，孩子们上学没了着落": "The school bus company stops running, leaving children with no way to school", "校车停了以后": "After the school bus stopped", "校车说停就停，我们上班赶不及，孩子每天怎么去学校？": "The school bus just stopped. We can’t make it to work on time — how are the children supposed to get to school?", "负责附近几所学校的校车公司突然停运，双职工家庭每天早上手忙脚乱。": "The bus company that served several nearby schools has suddenly stopped, and dual-income families are scrambling every morning.", "组织家长轮流接送": "Organise a parents’ rota", "协调家长轮班接送，让孩子结伴步行上学。": "Parents take turns on the school run, and children walk to school together.", "家长们轮流接送，孩子们结伴上学也更有伴。": "Parents share the school run, and the children enjoy walking to school together.", "建设课后集合点": "Build an after-school meeting point", "在社区设立课后与接送集合点，需要专人管理。": "An after-school and pick-up point in the neighbourhood, run by dedicated staff.", "孩子放学有了安全的去处，家长下班也能安心接回。": "Children have a safe place after school, and parents can collect them after work without worry.", "同一层的邻居们": "Neighbours on the same floor", "多户同时装修，噪音和粉尘引发争吵": "Several flats renovating at once spark rows over noise and dust", "装修季的争吵": "Renovation season rows", "天天电钻声，上夜班的人睡不了，孩子也没法做功课。": "Drilling every day. Night-shift workers can’t sleep and the children can’t do their homework.", "几户人家同时进行翻新，噪音、粉尘和走廊堆放的建材让邻里关系越来越紧张。": "Several households are renovating at once. Noise, dust and building materials stacked in the corridor are straining relations between neighbours.", "调解施工时间": "Mediate the work hours", "约齐装修户和邻居，商定安静时段与清洁安排。": "Bring the renovating households and their neighbours together to agree quiet hours and clean-up.", "装修户和邻居有了共同的约定，争吵少了。": "The renovating households and their neighbours agreed on rules, and the rows died down.", "改善走廊与公共空间": "Improve corridors and shared spaces", "翻新走廊、增设收纳与隔音设施，施工期间会暂时更吵。": "Refurbish the corridors and add storage and sound-proofing; it is noisier while the works go on.", "走廊变整洁了，以后再有装修也不那么扰人。": "The corridors are tidier now, and future renovations disturb people less.", "年长住户": "Older residents", "多名年长住户接到诈骗电话，有人被骗走积蓄": "Scam calls target older residents, and one loses her savings", "电话那头的骗局": "The scam on the line", "那人说是银行打来的，我差点把养老钱都转出去了。": "He said he was calling from the bank. I nearly transferred all my retirement savings.", "冒充银行和政府官员的诈骗电话接连打给年长住户，已经有人被骗走积蓄，大家既害怕又羞于开口。": "Callers posing as bank staff and government officers keep phoning older residents. Some have already lost their savings, and people are both frightened and ashamed to speak up.", "举办防诈骗分享会": "Hold scam-awareness sessions", "在底层举办防诈骗分享，教长者辨认可疑电话。": "Sessions on the void deck teach older residents to spot suspicious calls.", "长者学会了辨认骗局，遇到可疑电话会先找人商量。": "Older residents learned to recognise scams and now check with someone before acting on a suspicious call.", "设立社区咨询窗口": "Open a community advice desk", "设立可以随时求助、核实信息的咨询窗口，需要专人值守。": "An advice desk where people can ask for help and check information at any time; it needs dedicated staff.", "长者有了可以信任的求助窗口，被骗的人也少了。": "Older residents have a desk they trust, and fewer people are being scammed.", "有长者和幼儿的家庭": "Families with elders and young children", "烟霾笼罩数周，空气质量持续不健康": "Weeks of haze keep the air at unhealthy levels", "烟霾季节": "Haze season", "窗都不敢开，老人咳个不停，孩子也不能出去玩。": "We don’t dare open the windows. The old folks keep coughing and the children can’t go out to play.", "区域烟霾笼罩数周，空气质量指数持续在不健康水平，长者和幼儿出现呼吸不适。": "Regional haze has hung over the area for weeks. Air quality stays unhealthy, and older people and young children are struggling to breathe.", "分发口罩并开放净化室": "Hand out masks and open a clean-air room", "向长者和幼儿家庭分发口罩，开放有空气净化的活动室。": "Masks for households with elders and young children, and an activity room with air purifiers.", "烟霾期间，最脆弱的居民有了避开烟霾的地方。": "During the haze, the most vulnerable residents have somewhere to escape it.", "改善公共室内空气": "Improve indoor air in shared spaces", "为社区中心加装空气净化与通风设备，需要长期维护。": "Fit air purification and ventilation in the community centre; it needs ongoing upkeep.", "社区中心成了烟霾天也能安心待着的地方。": "The community centre has become a place to stay safely even on hazy days."});

Object.assign((typeof window!=="undefined"?window:globalThis).CM_YEAR_TRANSLATIONS,{"七年里邻居换了不少。楼下的棋桌留住了许多见面的习惯，他们想把它留给以后。": "Over seven years many neighbours have come and gone. The chess table downstairs kept a lot of meeting habits alive, and they want to leave it for whoever comes next."});
Object.assign((typeof window!=="undefined"?window:globalThis).CM_YEAR_TRANSLATIONS,{"走过这七年，楼下哪一处你最希望留下来？": "Looking back on these seven years, which spot downstairs do you most hope will stay?"});
